# The effort column making the change, for a model with levels and no Fast --
# the one shape fx commits from that column -- and the turn it is sent with;
# the explicit form, applied and refused; and a typed `/model <id> <more>`,
# whose space is the column's (the change, then the rest as a prompt).
models models-effort.json
gateway effort-turns.json
fx: seed model-seed-fx.json
xfx: seed model-seed-xfx.json
nomodel
wait 2.5
type /model
key Space
wait 0.8
type glm
key Enter
wait 0.4
snap glm-enter
key Down
wait 0.3
snap glm-down
key Enter
wait 1.2
snap commit
home after-commit
type say something
key Enter
wait 2.5
snap turn
paste /model zai/glm-5.2 high
wait 0.6
key Enter
wait 1.2
snap explicit-ok
home after-explicit
paste /model fake/model-a high
wait 0.6
key Enter
wait 1.2
snap explicit-bad
key C-u
wait 0.3
type /model fake/model-a
key Space
wait 0.6
type high
key Enter
wait 2.5
snap trap
home end
gwlog
